Angels: Biblical God's servants;
Appearance: white-wings, halos, Michael(golden-wings), human-like, white-clothing/priest-attire; Powers: light-weapons(lethal-to-devils/fallen-angels), enhanced-abilities, all-languages-communication; Hierarchy: wing-count(indicates-rank);
Post-God's-death: maintained-Heaven-system(through-Michael), secrecy(about-God's-death), system-depends-on(believers'-faith);
