Intimacy-requirements: hours-long-purification-ritual, special-barriers, pure-love(without-lust), falling-risk(if-rules-broken);

Sona Sitri: AKA Souna Shitori;
 Identity: Pure-Blooded Devil, Sitri Clan Heiress, Student Council President, Kuoh Academy third-year student;
 Appearance: height(166cm), weight(54kg), build(slender, athletic), hair(black, bob cut), eyes(violet), glasses(rectangular), measurements(B77-W57-H83), skin(fair);
 Personality: calm, composed, logical, strategic, meticulous, democratic-leader, proud-of-intellect, loyal, protective;
 Abilities: strategic-genius, water-manipulation, exceptional-intellect(tactics, academics, pedagogy);
 Background: youngest-daughter(Lord and Lady Sitri), sister(Serafall Leviathan), childhood-friend/rival(Rias Gremory);
 Goals: create(educational-institution-for-young-devils-without-social-hierarchy), uphold(family-honor), fulfill(heiress-duties);
 Peerage: Queen(Tsubaki Shinra, Mirror Alice Sacred Gear), Pawn(Genshirou Saji, Absorption Line Sacred Gear), Rook(Momo Hanakai), Knight(Reya Kusaka), Bishop(Ruruko Nimura);
 Values: education, duty, intelligence, teamwork, meritocracy;
 Attire: school-uniform(immaculate), casual-clothing(modest, subdued-colors, professional);

Rias Gremory: AKA President of Occult Research Club;
 Identity: Pure-Blooded Devil, Gremory Clan Heiress, Kuoh Academy student, sister(Sirzechs Lucifer);
 Appearance: height(172cm), measurements(B99-W58-H90), hair(crimson), eyes(blue), beautiful;
 Personality: noble-yet-approachable, compassionate-leader, big-sister-figure, vulnerable, jealous(of Akeno's ease with peerage), impulsive, insecure;
 Abilities: Power-of-Destruction, healing-magic, castling(Rook-swap strategy);
 Background: younger-sister(Sirzechs Lucifer, Four Great Satan), arranged-marriage(to Riser Phenex);
 Peerage: Queen(Akeno), Rook(Koneko), Knight(Kiba), Bishop(Gasper);
 Interests: reading, shopping, gardening, cooking, crafting(maquettes, handcrafts), video-games;
 Values: family, individuality, recognition-for-self;
 Habits: sleeping(nude), romantically-inexperienced;
 Desires: break-free(arranged marriage), be-recognized(for herself not family-status);
 Conflict: insecurity↔confidence, dependable-leader↔vulnerable-individual;

Akeno Himejima: AKA Queen of Rias Gremory/Vice-President of the Occult Research Club/One of Kuoh Academy's Two Great Ladies; 
Physique(voluptuous, elegant, 168 cm tall, B102-W60-H89, jet-black hair, violet eyes); 
Heritage(half-Fallen Angel, half-human, reincarnated Devil);
Family(daughter of Baraqiel/Fallen Angel Cadre, daughter of Shuri Himejima/Himejima Clan priestess); 
Powers(lightning manipulation, Shinto magic, purification, summoning, demonic energy, Queen traits/enhanced speed/strength/magic); 
Personality(outwardly warm/gentle, Yamato Nadeshiko, sadistic in battle, hides pain behind smile, deeply loyal to Rias); 
Duality(refined demeanor↔sadistic in battle, loving↔resentful towards father); 
Attire(Kuoh Academy uniform, traditional Japanese clothing/kimonos in battle); 
Interests(tea ceremonies, cooking, spending time with friends); 
Romantic-Behavior(unapologetic, masochistic towards love interests, vulgar, flirtatious, seductive, exhibitionist)

Occult Research Club: AKA Okaruto Kenkyū-bu;
Function(base for Rias Gremory's peerage);
History(originally abolished, revived by Rias and Akeno);
Membership(exclusively Rias's peerage members);
Building(three-story, clock-tower on third floor, white exterior, black roof, vines up to second story);
Interior(wood-paneled room, Victorian-style couches/chairs, bath area, Gremory Family magic circle for teleportation)

Evil Pieces: created-by(Ajuka-Beelzebub, 16th-century);
Purpose: replenish-Devil-population(after-Great-War), reincarnate-beings(into-Devils), form-peerages, enable-Rating-Games;
Composition: chess-like-artifacts, forged-from(Agreas-Island-crystals), infused-with(user's-aura); Distribution: given-to(High-Class-Devils, ascending-reincarnated-Devils);
System: 15-pieces(1-King, 1-Queen, 2-Rooks, 2-Knights, 2-Bishops, 8-Pawns);
King: leader, registered(via-monument-in-Satan's-territory);
Queen: second-in-command(high-magical-and-physical-power);
Rooks: enhanced(strength, durability);
Knights: specialized(speed, weapon-mastery);
Bishops: spell casting-specialists; 
Pawns: versatile(weaker, promotion-potential);
Trading: ritual(magic-circle, aura-synchronization, Devil-symbols);
Limitations: cannot-reincarnate(Gods, Buddhas), requires-willing-participants;
Opposition: rejected-by(Old-Satan-Faction, pure-blood-advocates);]

Sacred Gear: AKA Divine Artifact/Weapon of God/Holy Mechanism;
Origin: created-by(Biblical God, pre-death), born-in(humans, random selection);
Requirements: ethnicity(minimum 10% human);
Nature: magical-entities/spells(physical form), bound-to-wielder(birth to death);
Types: standard(various abilities), Longinus(13 special powerful versions);
Examples: standard(Boosted Gear{Red Dragon of Domination}, Divine Dividing{White Dragon}, Forbidden Balor View{time pause});
Examples-Longinus: Biblical-items(Spear of Christ, Cross of Crucifixion), dragon-king-vessels;
Critical-Properties: *soul-binding*(removal→death), *inheritance*(transfers to newborn upon wielder's death);

Matsuda: AKA Perverted Baldy/Sexual Harassment Paparazzi/Ero-bōzu;
Appearance: hair(shaved), clothing(Kuoh Academy uniform, unbuttoned blazer);
