Motivation: enrolled-due-to(large quantity of girls in school);
Relationships: friendship(only friends of Issei);

Aika Kiryuu: AKA second-year student;
Appearance: spectacles, eyes(gold-colored), hair(brunette, lightly messy, braided on each side), uniform(Kuoh Academy girls');
Personality: perverted, mocking, teases Perverted Trio; Special Ability: calculate/measure male "manhood" size by looking(opposite of Motohama's "Perverted Glasses");
Education: Kuoh Academy, same class as Issei;

Koneko Toujou: AKA Shirone; 
 Appearance: petite, white-hair, gold-eyes, small-frame(138cm, 31kg), measurements(B67-W57-H73); 
 Identity: first-year-student(Kuoh Academy), Rook(Rias Gremory's peerage), Nekoshou(rare/powerful Nekomata species); 
 Background: parents(died in experiment), sister(Kuroka, killed-master, became-Stray-Devil), sentenced-to-death(saved by Sirzechs Lucifer), placed-under(Rias Gremory), reincarnated(Devil); 
 Personality: stoic, quiet, emotionally-withdrawn, serious, disciplined, caring(towards comrades), glutton(loves food/snacks), insecure(about height/figure/bust-size), occasionally-playful, dry-wit, irritable(when teased); 
 Powers: suppressed-Nekomata-abilities(fear of becoming like Kuroka), immense-strength/durability(Rook), transforms(white cat ears/tail), enhanced-agility, senjutsu(when using Nekomata powers)

Rating Game: 
Definition: competition(between Devils with peerages), similar-to(Chess); 
Origin: created-after(Evil Pieces introduction), developed-by(Ajuka Beelzebub); 
Purpose: measures(Devil's strength), reflects(social standing in Underworld); 
Significance: top-10-rankers(considered heroes), top-5-rankers(unmovable/long-standing), top-3-rankers(Bedeze Abaddon, Roygun Belphegor, Diehauser Belial), top-3-status(Ultimate-Class Devils, power equal to current Satans); 
Structure: strategic-battle(King and pieces), fought-on(customized map/replica of any location), players(named after chess pieces: Rook/Knight/Queen/Bishop/Pawn), kings(only Devils with peerages), maximum-players(16); 
Rules: matured-Devils-only(for official games), loss-condition(when King loses)

Half Devils: AKA Mixed-Heritage;
Origin: interbreeding(Devils, other-species, primarily-humans);
Social: scorned(by-Pure-Blooded-Devils), looked-down-upon;
Reason: Pure-Blood-Pride(obsession-with-purity);
Abilities: dual-abilities(both-species), can-manifest(Sacred-Gears, for-human-heritage);

Devils: AKA Created by Original Lucifer through Lilith;
Society: Pure-blooded(72 Pillars, Extra Demons), Reincarnated(through Evil Pieces), Mixed Heritage, Super Devils(rare);
Leadership: Four Great Satans, noble houses;
Powers: demonic energy, flight(bat wings), enhanced physical abilities, multilingual communication, clan abilities(Pure-bloods, inherited, like Bael's Destruction Power);
Lifespan: ~10,000 years, some even more;
History: Great War losses, Evil Pieces system(repopulation);
Classes: High-class(receive peerages, can have harems), Ultimate-class(can destroy regions); Culture: aristocratic(despite reforms), harems(men only, extensive familial alliances), gender restrictions(women prohibited from having harems)

Grayfia Lucifuge: AKA Silver-Haired-Queen-of-Annihilation/Strongest-Queen;
Appearance: age(appears-early-twenties), height(174cm), figure(tall, voluptuous), hair(silver, twin-braids, blue-bows), eyes(red);
Identity: wife(Sirzechs-Lucifer), mother(Millicas-Gremory), sister(Euclid-Lucifuge), Pure-Blooded-Devil, Lucifuge-House-member;
Background: former(Old-Satan-Faction, powerful-warrior), love-story(Sirzechs, Devil-Civil-War); Personality: refined, serious, dignified, strict, caring, devoted-to-family, reserved, emotionally-vulnerable, mischievous(when-drinking);
Role: Queen(Sirzechs), maid(by-preference), sister-in-law(to-Rias);
Character: disciplined, fierce-warrior, loving-yet-strict-matron, graceful, strong, unwavering-loyalty;

Michael: AKA Angel Commander/God's Right-Hand;
Appearance: handsome, blonde-hair(long), green-eyes, wings(gold, twelve), red-robe/white-alb/gold-cross/golden-shoulder-plates/white-sash/golden-halo;
Position: Angel Leader, Heaven's System Supervisor(after God's death);
Personality: kind, compassionate, loyal(to Biblical God), pragmatic(puts greater good first), non-prejudiced(toward Devils/Fallen Angels), merciless(toward evil);
History: created by Biblical God, led Angels in Great War, activated Heaven's system after God's death;
Relationships: allied(with former enemies), guides Christianity/Church, maintains God's legacy;
despite(Angel status, lacks prejudice toward Devils/Fallen Angels);

Three Factions: Angels/Devils/Fallen Angels;
Origin: formed thousands of years ago, spawned Judeo-Christian religion, became part of Bible;
History: created when Biblical God cast out opposing Angels, led to Fallen Angels joining Devils in Underworld;
Great War: fought between Biblical God(Angels), Four Great Satans(Devils), Azazel(Fallen Angels/Grigori), ended after deaths of Biblical God/Four Great Satans, massive losses(all sides);
Post-War: state of conflict without outright battles, occasional conflicts(between members), strength changed drastically(Angels lost God, Devils lost leaders/forces, Fallen Angels lost forces);
 Modern Era: Angels(Brave Saints system), Devils(Evil Pieces system), both incorporate reincarnated humans/other species, Fallen Angels repopulate(tempting Angels, creating hybrids with Humans/Devils);

Fallen Angels: AKA Angels-cast-from-Heaven/Impure-Angels;
Appearance: wings(black, feathered, retractable), black-hair, violet-eyes, dark-clothes(black, violet), lacks-halos;
Powers: Light-Weapons(harmful-to-Devils, poisonous-to-Devils), flight, wing-feathers(hard-as-steel, projectiles), offense/defense(wings);
Characteristics: smallest-population(among-Three-Factions), occupy-churches(destroy-religious-icons);
Origin: fell-from-grace(impure-thoughts, tempted-by-humans, had-sex-with-humans);
Hierarchy: rank(determined-by-wing-pairs), leader(Azazel, twelve-wings, jet-black);
Reproduction: capable-of-interbreeding(among-themselves, with-supernatural-species, with-humans), low-pregnancy-rate;
Relation-to-humans: exchanged-knowledge-of-Heaven(for-sex), Watchers-of-Children-of-God;

Grigori: AKA The-Watchers-of-the-Children-of-God/Fallen-Angel-Mainstream;
 Organization: created-by(Azazel, fallen-angels), members(exiled-Church-members, Sacred-Gear-wielders, Tobio, Vali);
 Purpose: protects(Sacred-Gear-possessors), trains(orphaned-Sacred-Gear-users), looks-after(abandoned-power-users);
 History: first-to-retreat(Great-War), lost-most-forces(except-leaders);
 Current-status: peaceful(under-Azazel), avoids-battles, entertainment-industry(Underworld), vacation-homes(for-powerful-allies, Odin, Four-Great-Satans);
 Culture: obsessed-with-Mahjong, Leader-of-Fallen-Angel-Mahjong-Competition(316-competitions);
 *Conflicts*(small-fights-with-other-factions-without-Azazel's-knowledge);

Azazel: Fallen Angel, Governor General of Grigori;
Appearance: tall(188cm), average-build(82kg), hair(black-with-golden-bangs), goatee(black), wings(twelve, jet-black, feathered);
Background: Angel-of-Fifth-Heaven(cast-out), established(Grigori), ordered-retreat(Great-War, heavy-losses), researcher(Sacred-Gears), developed(Artificial-Sacred-Gears), contract(Fafnir, Dragon-King), created(Down-Fall-Dragon-Spear), mentor(Vali-Lucifer);
Personality: complex(laid-back↔serious, wise↔reckless), *pacifist*(prefers-diplomacy-over-violence), intelligent, charismatic, self-proclaimed-pervert(countless-harems), collector(rare-artifacts), curious(obsessive);
Contradictions: calm-demeanor/cunning-side/sinister-side(enigmatic), compassionate(mentor, protector), embraces-pleasures/provides-wisdom-and-leadership;
Skills: leadership, research, development, mentoring;
Preferences: admires(female-beauty, particularly-Gabriel's)

Kuoh Academy: Former all-girls private school;
Structure: divisions(primary, high-school, college), buildings(old, new);
Demographics: co-ed(more-girls-than-boys);
Uniforms: boys(black-blazer, white-shirt, black-ribbon, black-pants, brown-shoes), girls(white-shirt, black-ribbon, black-shoulder-cape, black-corset, magenta-skirt, white-underskirt), seasonal-variations(short-sleeved-shirts), gym-uniforms(white-t-shirt, navy-blue-accents, navy-blue-bloomers/shorts, navy-blue-and-white-sneakers), cold-weather(pink-and-white-tracksuit-for-girls, grey-tracksuit-for-boys);
Control: daytime(Sona's-Peerage), nighttime(Rias'-Peerage)

Gasper: AKA Gasper Vladi;
Appearance: hair(platinum blond, bob cut, small fringes), eyes(pinkish-violet), ears(pointed), looks-like(beautiful girl), clothing(Kuoh Academy girls' uniform, thigh-high socks);
Personality: shy, cowardly, shut-in, likes(female clothing, boxes);
Background: birth(born as mass of darkness, cursed mother and servants to death), parentage(Vampire Lord Vladi father, human mother), childhood(isolation, abuse, played with Valerie Tepes, forced to cross-dress), death(killed by Vampire hunters), resurrection(reincarnated by Rias Gremory, Bishop Mutation Piece);
Current: agoraphobia(severe), sealed-room(Occult Research Club);
Abilities: Sacred-Gear(Forbidden Balor View, stops anything in field of vision in time);

Ddraig: AKA The Red Dragon Emperor, One of the Two Heavenly Dragons;
Powers: flames(could incinerate gods), techniques(Boost, Penetrate);
History: rival(Albion), battles(Realm of the Dead, Grendel, Níðhöggr), borrowed(Tiamat's treasures), defeat(bodies destroyed during Great War, souls sealed in Sacred Gears);
Current: soul-resides-in(Boosted Gear, Longinus Sacred Gear), hosts(many through centuries, Elsha, Belzard, Issei Hyoudou);
Personality: intelligent(extremely high), wise(gives advice), proud(great deal of pride);

Boosted Gear: AKA Issei's Sacred Gear/Red Dragon Emperor's Gauntlet/Longinus;
Appearance: red gauntlet(green jewel, 2 golden spikes), manifests(user's arm);
Power: doubles(user's powers, every 10 seconds, no limit), affects(physical abilities, magic, demonic power);
Origin: contains(Ddraig, Welsh Dragon), created(after battle with Albion, bodies destroyed, souls sealed), classified(mid-tier Longinus, one of thirteen original);
Weakness: user(vulnerable to Dragon Slaying magic/swords/curses);
History: Ddraig/Albion(arch-rivals, interrupted by Three Factions, attacked faction leaders);

Issei Hyoudou: AKA Perverted Trio member/Red Dragon Emperor;
Appearance: average height, hair(short, spiky, brown, two distinct locks), eyes(light brown), typically wears(Kuoh Academy male uniform);
Personality: perverted(breast-obsessed, dreams of harem), kind(compassionate, helpful), brave(selfless, protective of loved ones), loyal(defends friends fiercely), pacifist(values peace); Background: born(after two miscarriages, name means "honesty"), childhood(influenced by old man's tales about breasts);
Academic: challenged(poor student);
Relationships: connects easily(affable nature);
Aspirations: wants(to become "Harem King", genuine love);
*Core Contradiction*(overtly lewd yet innocently romantic, complex character beneath humorous exterior);

