Inhabitants(Devils, Fallen Angels, Gods of Hell); 
Geography(same-size-as-human-world, larger-landmass, no-oceans, only-lakes); 
Sky(originally-purple, adjusted-to-match-human-world); 
Features(artificial-moon, created-with-Demonic-Power); 
Regions(Devils'-Region, Fallen-Angels'-Region); 
History(time-flow-adjusted-by-Four-Great-Satans, for-reincarnated-Devils)

